{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30636","headline":"将归蜀留献恩地仆射二首 二 · 姚鹄","name":"将归蜀留献恩地仆射二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上长思狎钓翁，此心难与昨心同。\n自承丘壑新恩重，已分烟霞旧隐空。\n龙变偶因资巨浪，鸟飞谁肯借高风。\n应怜死节无门効，永叹潜怀似转蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30636.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30636","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}